    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE APRIL 30, 1978\nFLIGHT TIMES\nSan Francisco\nSan Jose\nLos Angeles\nTSan Luis Obispo\nSanta Maria\nPaso Robles\nSacramento\nFresno\nBakersfield\nVisalia\nNOW FLYING ... 29-PASSENGER NORD\n262 PROP-JETS ON SELECTED ROUTES",
      "REDDING\nSACRAMENTO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nSWIFE\nSystem\nMap\nSAN JOSE\nFRESNO\nPASO\nROBLES\nVISALIA\nSAN LUIS OBISPO\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA MARIA\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nI ROUTES PENDING\nSAVE WITH JOINT FARES\nYou can fly Swift Aire free, or at greatly reduced fares,\nwhen you connect on other airlines for flights to many\nlocations in the U.S.\nSWIFT AIRE AND AVIS\nRent a fine Avis car at destinations served by Swift Aire.\nSwift Aire and Avis, getting together to serve you better.\nFor Reservations and Flight Information\nIn California, Call Toll Free\n800/592-5900\n(Outside California, Dial (805) 544-4677.)\nIn San Luis Obispo-.\n-544-4677\nIn Santa Maria-.\n_ 925-0987\nIn Paso Robles\n238-5700\nOr see your travel agent."
